# COMP-09 golden — member enumeration AS IT BEHAVES TODAY.
# Regenerated by MemberEnumerationGoldenTest; one fact per line so a movement is a
# one-line diff in review.
#
# <receiver>|global|<member>:<type>      resolveGlobal -> materialize -> getMembers
# <receiver>|class|<member>:<type>       resolveType   -> materialize -> getMembers
# <receiver>|completion|<lookupString>   what `R.<caret>` offers
# <receiver>|completion:|<lookupString>  what `R:<caret>` offers
# override|<class>:<method>|<member>|<sourceElement class>|<file>
#
# The two doors are recorded SEPARATELY and never collapsed with `?:` (design §1.4,
# §4.4a): two of these receivers resolve through only one door, and on `Shapes` the
# global door hoists `deep` from `Shapes.nested.deep` — BUG-430, a defect this file
# records rather than endorses. COMP-09 preserves the CLASS door.
wx|shape|bare-table binding plus syntactic members: R = {} + R.f = v + function R.f()
wx|global|wxFileExists:fun(filename)
wx|global|wxID_ANY:nil | number
wx|class|wxFileExists:fun(filename)
wx|class|wxID_ANY:nil
wx|completion|wxFileExists
wx|completion|wxID_ANY
wx|completion:|wxFileExists
Config|shape|pure table literal: R = { a = 1 }
Config|global|host:string
Config|global|port:number
Config|class|<unresolvable>
Config|completion|host
Config|completion|port
Config|completion:|<none>
M|shape|table literal plus syntactic: R = { a = 1 } + function R.f()
M|global|DEBUG:boolean
M|global|VERSION:string
M|global|f:fun()
M|class|<unresolvable>
M|completion|DEBUG
M|completion|VERSION
M|completion|f
M|completion:|f
Busted|shape|opaque binding: R = require(x)
Busted|global|unregister:fun(n) | fun(n)
Busted|class|<unresolvable>
Busted|completion|unregister
Busted|completion:|<none>
OM|shape|opaque binding plus syntactic: R = require(x) + function R.f()
OM|global|unregister:fun(n) | fun(n)
OM|class|<unresolvable>
OM|completion|unregister
OM|completion:|<none>
luassert|shape|@class on a local, dot member — the require target
luassert|global|<unresolvable>
luassert|class|unregister:fun(n)
luassert|completion|<none>
luassert|completion:|<none>
wxFrame|shape|@class on a local, dot AND colon members, @field
wxFrame|global|<unresolvable>
wxFrame|class|GetTitle:fun()
wxFrame|class|Show:fun(show)
wxFrame|class|staticCount:fun()
wxFrame|class|title:string
wxFrame|completion|<none>
wxFrame|completion:|<none>
AllColon|shape|@class on a local, every member colon-declared
AllColon|global|<unresolvable>
AllColon|class|alpha:fun()
AllColon|class|beta:fun()
AllColon|completion|<none>
AllColon|completion:|<none>
Shapes|shape|nested qualifier: a.b.c = v
Shapes|global|deep:number
Shapes|global|direct:number
Shapes|global|nested:{ ... }
Shapes|global|plain:fun()
Shapes|class|direct:number
Shapes|class|nested:{ ... }
Shapes|class|plain:fun()
Shapes|completion|deep
Shapes|completion|direct
Shapes|completion|nested
Shapes|completion|plain
Shapes|completion:|plain
Base|shape|@class on a bare global, @field signature plus a colon method
Base|global|Show:fun()
Base|global|inheritedFn:fun()
Base|class|Show:fun()
Base|class|inheritedField:string
Base|class|inheritedFn:fun()
Base|class|onClose:undefined
Base|completion|Show
Base|completion|inheritedFn
Base|completion:|Show
Base|completion:|inheritedFn
Derived|shape|@class D : Base on a bare global, @field plus an overriding method
Derived|global|Show:fun()
Derived|global|ownFn:fun()
Derived|class|Show:fun()
Derived|class|inheritedField:string
Derived|class|inheritedFn:fun()
Derived|class|onClose:undefined
Derived|class|ownField:number
Derived|class|ownFn:fun()
Derived|completion|Show
Derived|completion|ownFn
Derived|completion:|Show
Derived|completion:|ownFn
override|Derived:Show|Show|LuaFuncDeclImpl|base.lua
override|Derived:onClose|onClose|LuaCatsFieldTagImpl|base.lua
override|Derived:inheritedFn|inheritedFn|LuaFuncDeclImpl|base.lua
override|Derived:ownFn|<none>

